Phase 3.1 Config Verification Report
=====================================

TESTS: test_config_sources_and_validation,
       test_diagnostics_report_counts_and_locks,
       test_cli_config_check_invalid_exits_5

CONFIG INVARIANTS VERIFIED
--------------------------
1. Config sources and validation
   - load_config(path, env={}) loads from file source
   - loaded.source("core") == "file" when config from file
   - loaded.source("permissions") == "default" (not set in file)
   - Bad config validation catches issues
   - "unattended_ceiling" > 1 triggers warning
   - "max_attempts" <= 0 triggers warning

2. Diagnostics report counts and locks
   - gather(config) returns report dict
   - report["tasks"]["records"] == task count
   - report["tasks"]["malformed"] == 0 (clean state)
   - report["audit"]["events"] >= 1 (events present)
   - report["storage"]["memory"]["raw_events"] >= 1
   - report["locks"]["tasks"] == "free" (no leases held)

3. CLI config --check invalid exits 5
   - main(["--config", str(path), "config", "--check"]) == EXIT_CONFIG
   - Bad config file (unattended_ceiling: 9) rejected
   - Exit code 5 indicates configuration invalid

CONFIG SOURCES
--------------
- "default": no config file, use defaults
- "file": config from specified file path
- "env": environment variables override
- "override": overrides dict takes precedence
- Source tracking: loaded.source("key") returns origin

VALIDATION RULES
----------------
- unattended_ceiling: max 1 for unattended operation
- max_attempts: must be > 0
- verification before execute: can be required or bypassed
- Provider configs: checked for sensible values

DIAGNOSTICS INVARIANTS
----------------------
- Reports task count, malformed count
- Reports audit event count
- Reports memory raw event count
- Reports lock status (free/busy/held)
- All counts non-negative
- malformed always >= 0
- events always >= 0 when data present

EXIT CODES:
- EXIT_OK (0): config valid, diagnostics green
- EXIT_CONFIG (5): configuration invalid